# head/adult/marks_beauty: a beauty mark: one dark pixel high on the cheek beside the eye
# P2b FACES (wave 2). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role marks beauty
layer face
anchor head
keys rest
z 1
tags overlay mirror-ok

view D key rest origin -12 -11
|q

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -10 -12
|q

view L key rest origin 0 0
|.
